  "source_conclusions": [
    "The formerly missing producer join is explicit: _jt -> export my -> renderer import Zwr -> MDo -> lVt -> GOo -> ROo text muted=!isPreviewMessage.",
    "QOo is reached from JOo only for a truthy top-level result.is_error; index selector die independently requires is_error===true.",
    "QOo labels agent errors Codex, Cursor, otherwise Claude Code from session agentType or gu(model); no isPreviewMessage/collapse input or decision in this body.",
    "QOo uses errors??[], removes [ede_diagnostic]-prefixed entries, normalizes the first remaining error or result via dDi, and suppresses diagnostic-only nonempty errors arrays unless the earlier Claude auth/unsupported-model branch takes precedence.",
